o\ndoesn't need one to function.", "originalText": "Embedding / TF-IDF similarity search over a small, clearly-labeled\nillustrative clause set (not a real insurer's document) -> cites the\nspecific clause it used, or states 'not established' rather than guessing.\nA real LLM call is an optional local-run enhancement -- the public demo\ndoesn't need one to function.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1154, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2154, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "line", "id": "divider6", "x": 60, "y": 1775, "width": 1540, "height": 0, "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1160, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2160, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [1540, 0]]}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_s6_s7", "x": 260, "y": 1723, "width": 0, "height": 95, "strokeColor": "#6d28d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1161, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2161, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0, 95]], "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "text", "id": "s7_title", "x": 480, "y": 1788, "width": 700, "height": 24, "text": "7. Explainable Result", "originalText": "7. Explainable Result", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1170, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2170, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "ellipse", "id": "s7_hero", "x": 60, "y": 1818, "width": 400, "height": 130, "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1171, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2171, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "s7_hero_text", "x": 60, "y": 1870, "width": 400, "height": 30, "text": "Explainable Result", "originalText": "Explainable Result", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1172, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2172, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "s7_status", "x": 60, "y": 1953, "width": 400, "height": 18, "text": "PLANNED \u2014 ships once phases 3-7 land", "originalText": "PLANNED \u2014 ships once phases 3-7 land", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1173, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2173, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "s7_detail", "x": 520, "y": 1828, "width": 1040, "height": 80, "text": "Every output ships with: which components were detected + confidence  *\nthe cost range + assumptions  *  the exact rule that fired  *\nwhat ISN'T known from the submitted evidence.", "originalText": "Every output ships with: which components were detected + confidence  *\nthe cost range + assumptions  *  the exact rule that fired  *\nwhat ISN'T known from the submitted evidence.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1174, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2174, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "s7_evidence_bg", "x": 520, "y": 1928, "width": 1040, "height": 150, "strokeColor": "#1e293b", "backgroundColor": "#1e293b", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1175, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2175, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "roundness": {"type": 3}}, {"type": "text", "id": "s7_evidence_text", "x": 540, "y": 1943, "width": 1000, "height": 120, "text": "Demo script (3 cases a reviewer sees in 60s):\nA -- scuffed bumper/fender -> Probably repairable, low cost ratio, high confidence\nB -- multi-panel front-end damage -> Probable total loss, ratio crosses threshold, reasoning shown\nC -- damage near structural zone -> Insufficient evidence -- inspection recommended (lead with this one)", "originalText": "Demo script (3 cases a reviewer sees in 60s):\nA -- scuffed bumper/fender -> Probably repairable, low cost ratio, high confidence\nB -- multi-panel front-end damage -> Probable total loss, ratio crosses threshold, reasoning shown\nC -- damage near structural zone -> Insufficient evidence -- inspection recommended (lead with this one)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 1176, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2176, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "gridSize": 20}, "files": {}}